{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/Steam_PageBanner_2.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build, Automate, Autocast!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your factory build <strong>from scratch</strong> to autocast your spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF7_2.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the 20-Minute Battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive <strong>relentless waves</strong> of monsters against the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF_clip_combo_01.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master a Plethora of Alchemical Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, the <strong>battle pauses</strong> while you\u2019re building and browsing through recipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF9_b_2.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shop til you Drop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on<strong> factory parts</strong>, totems, power crystals, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF13_2.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover your Dream Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which <strong>golden totems</strong> will you draft? Can you <strong>unlock </strong>them all for your <strong>collection</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF11_4.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Charms and Hexes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unpredictable <strong>boons </strong>and <strong>cursed zones </strong>require <strong>course-correction</strong> to keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF12_1.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Arcana Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer <strong>10 Difficulty Levels </strong>filled with challenges and <strong>elite </strong>monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF_clip_01.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete the Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More playable <strong>characters </strong>and<strong> legendary totems</strong> await your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/GIF_clip_04_2.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/wishlist_600px.gif?t=1748628245\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>23 Hidden Characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>80 Spell Recipes</strong> to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft from over <strong>80 Animal Totems</strong> to strengthen unique synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> after you survive the 20-minute battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph